[02:10.63]Ta-ra-ra, ta-ra-ra
[02:14.54]Ta-ra-ra-raaa
[02:17.80]Ta-ra-ra, ta-ra-ra
[02:21.72]We choose each other
# [VERSE 2]
[02:25.30]Talk to me
[02:27.91]about the language of dreams
[02:31.82]And building whole new worlds
[02:36.39]What if we create new cities?
[02:40.63]What if we travel through time?
[02:44.86]Travel through other realities
[02:48.78]and build our own empire
[02:53.01]If you go to Mars
[02:56.93]I'll stay home and walk the dog
